{"year":"2023","content":[{"type":"text","content_text":"The 28th edition was held on January 15, 2023, at the Fairmont Century Plaza in Los Angeles, broadcast by The CW. Comedian <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 151254, 'screen_type': person}\">Chelsea Handler</a> took over as host, ending Taye Diggs's run of four ceremonies. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 545611, 'screen_type': movie}\">Everything Everywhere All at Once</a> led the nominations (14) and the wins (5), including Best Picture and Best Director for <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1383612, 'screen_type': person}\">Daniel Kwan</a> and <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1317730, 'screen_type': person}\">Daniel Scheinert</a>. India's <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 579974, 'screen_type': movie}\">RRR</a> won Best Foreign Language Film and Best Song, with “Naatu Naatu.”<br/><br/>*<i>Television awards are not included</i>."},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Best Picture","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":545611,"name":"Everything Everywhere All at Once","image_path":"/2dSZQGwijlXvMSyuGe0FSgrXnv0.jpg","director":"Daniel Scheinert, Daniel Kwan","winner":true},{"type":"movie","id":76600,"name":"Avatar: The Way of Water","image_path":"/hm6nONQOgVpKmRK5YUX9EqfJ0NH.jpg","director":"James Cameron","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":615777,"name":"Babylon","image_path":"/qZUmMxJbGmkIYwnS7qRfSOREmvC.jpg","director":"Damien Chazelle","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":674324,"name":"The Banshees of Inisherin","image_path":"/rtJtaJ3ayYJ2PdwgZpEQyBETpyu.jpg","director":"Martin McDonagh","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":614934,"name":"Elvis","image_path":"/iekpzEjWsT7xLwm59U8ZqMIdkiM.jpg","director":"Baz Luhrmann","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":804095,"name":"The Fabelmans","image_path":"/meqKIZTsdSlbvv47uxvJH7Jcr7H.jpg","director":"Steven Spielberg","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":661374,"name":"Glass Onion: A Knives Out Mystery","image_path":"/zQJcEN